        "type": "game",
        "name": "Maestro Level Editor",
        "steam_appid": 3294210,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": true,
        "detailed_description": "<strong>Maestro Level Editor</strong> is the ultimate tool to bring your music to life. It serves both as a complete Virtual Symphony Orchestra Simulator and as a powerful Level Editor for creating content for <i>Maestro VR</i> and upcoming games in the Maestro saga by Symphonic Games.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> <strong>Create Your Virtual Symphony Orchestra:</strong> Choose from multiple concert halls with unique acoustics and configure your ensemble. Edit each instrument track by track, loading your own audio files (MP3/OGG) to place them in 3D space. Use individual tracks (STEMS) for maximum control or simulate an orchestra from stereo recordings for a unique immersive journey.<br><br></li><li> <strong>Hybrid &amp; Realistic Animation:</strong> Watch your virtual orchestra perform in real time. Animate musicians manually with drag-and-drop icons, or use the Smart Animation system to generate movements automatically from audio. For professional precision, import a MIDI file to sync bow strokes and fingerings with every note, and enjoy customizable lip-sync for the choir.<br><br></li><li> <strong>Create Levels for Maestro VR:</strong> Craft personalized rhythmic levels for <i>Maestro VR</i>. Use an intuitive interface with Smart Tempo tools to define conducting patterns, dynamics, and cues, designing your own symphonic challenges for the Virtual Reality game.<br><br></li><li> <strong>Share via Steam Workshop:</strong> Export your creations directly to the community. Share your original compositions as simulatable concerts for others to watch, or publish challenging gameplay levels for players to conduct.<br><br></li><li> <strong>Ideal for Composers and Gamers:</strong> Whether you want to visualize your own symphony or expand your game library, <strong>Maestro Level Editor</strong> allows you to simulate a realistic concert of your musical piece. It is the perfect bridge between music production and rhythm gaming. </li></ul><br>Start creating, simulating, and sharing with <strong>Maestro Level Editor</strong> and take your passion for music to the next level!",
        "about_the_game": "<strong>Maestro Level Editor</strong> is the ultimate tool to bring your music to life. It serves both as a complete Virtual Symphony Orchestra Simulator and as a powerful Level Editor for creating content for <i>Maestro VR</i> and upcoming games in the Maestro saga by Symphonic Games.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> <strong>Create Your Virtual Symphony Orchestra:</strong> Choose from multiple concert halls with unique acoustics and configure your ensemble. Edit each instrument track by track, loading your own audio files (MP3/OGG) to place them in 3D space. Use individual tracks (STEMS) for maximum control or simulate an orchestra from stereo recordings for a unique immersive journey.<br><br></li><li> <strong>Hybrid &amp; Realistic Animation:</strong> Watch your virtual orchestra perform in real time. Animate musicians manually with drag-and-drop icons, or use the Smart Animation system to generate movements automatically from audio. For professional precision, import a MIDI file to sync bow strokes and fingerings with every note, and enjoy customizable lip-sync for the choir.<br><br></li><li> <strong>Create Levels for Maestro VR:</strong> Craft personalized rhythmic levels for <i>Maestro VR</i>. Use an intuitive interface with Smart Tempo tools to define conducting patterns, dynamics, and cues, designing your own symphonic challenges for the Virtual Reality game.<br><br></li><li> <strong>Share via Steam Workshop:</strong> Export your creations directly to the community. Share your original compositions as simulatable concerts for others to watch, or publish challenging gameplay levels for players to conduct.<br><br></li><li> <strong>Ideal for Composers and Gamers:</strong> Whether you want to visualize your own symphony or expand your game library, <strong>Maestro Level Editor</strong> allows you to simulate a realistic concert of your musical piece. It is the perfect bridge between music production and rhythm gaming. </li></ul><br>Start creating, simulating, and sharing with <strong>Maestro Level Editor</strong> and take your passion for music to the next level!",
        "short_description": "Maestro Level Editor is both a Virtual Symphony Simulator and a Level Editor for Maestro VR. Customize your orchestra, mix real audio tracks, and sync realistic animations. Design rhythmic levels and share your creations on Steam Workshop. Conduct your own music!",
